---
import { questions, orderedVideos, stageLabels, stages } from '../../public/money-at-work/data.js';
const initial = questions[0];
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#221C4A"/><title>Wealth Planning for Business Owners | RIPL Wealth</title><meta name="description" content="You built the business. Now build what’s next. Personal wealth planning, tax-aware investing, and real conversations for business owners at RIPL Wealth."/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/money-at-work/style.css"/></head><body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
<header class="site-header"><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="RIPL Wealth home"><img src="/ripl-logo.png" alt="RIPL Wealth" width="112" height="40"/><span>BUILD TOMORROW TODAY.</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#videos">Watch & learn</a><a href="#about">Meet Adam</a><a class="button button-small" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-placement="header">Talk with Adam <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav></div></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-story"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="gold-line"></span> WEALTH PLANNING FOR BUSINESS OWNERS</p><h1 id="hero-title">You built the business.<br/><em>Now build what’s next.</em></h1><p class="hero-support">Your business takes care of a lot of people. Who’s helping you turn that success into personal wealth? We bring investments, tax-aware planning, and your bigger picture together.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button hero-book" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-placement="hero">See if we’re a fit — 30 min <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="hero-review-link" href="#quiz">Take the 2-minute money review ↓</a></div><p class="hero-reassurance">A real conversation over Zoom. No obligation or paperwork.</p><figure class="team-photo"><img src="/money-at-work/images/team.webp" alt="The RIPL Wealth team together in their Fort Collins office" width="1200" height="800" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><span>Meet the people behind the advice.</span><span>Fort Collins, Colorado</span></figcaption></figure><p class="hero-caption">Real people. Thoughtful work. Straight answers.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="human-intro wrap" aria-label="A note from Adam"><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam.webp" alt="Adam Kasick" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy"/><div><p>“You don’t need to have this all figured out.<br class="desktop"/> That’s a perfectly good reason to start a conversation.”</p><span>Adam Kasick <i>·</i> Business owner & wealth manager</span></div><a href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com" class="text-link">Ask me a question ↗</a></section>

<section class="confidence wrap" aria-labelledby="confidence-title">
  <div class="confidence-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE ABOUT WHO YOU’RE TRUSTING</p><h2 id="confidence-title">Real people. <em>Credentials you can check.</em></h2></div><p>We believe trust starts with straight answers about who we are, how we work, and where your assets are held.</p></div>
  <div class="confidence-grid">
    <article class="confidence-item"><span class="confidence-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h3>Registered investment adviser</h3><p>Investment advisory services are provided through RIPL Wealth, LLC, a registered investment adviser. You can check firm registration and disclosures independently.</p><a href="https://adviserinfo.sec.gov/Firm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Verify RIPL on the SEC’s IAPD site <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
    <article class="confidence-item"><span class="confidence-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h3>Adam’s professional background</h3><p>Adam has passed the Series 7 and Series 66 securities qualification examinations. Exam history does not itself mean a registration is currently active.</p><a href="https://brokercheck.finra.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Review Adam’s record on BrokerCheck <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
    <article class="confidence-item"><span class="confidence-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h3>Independent asset custody</h3><p>RIPL works with Altruist as an independent, third-party custody platform. Client assets are not held in RIPL’s own bank account.</p><span class="confidence-detail">A clear separation between your adviser and your custodian.</span></div></article>
  </div>
  <div class="vanguard-note"><div class="vanguard-note-heading"><span class="vanguard-mark" aria-hidden="true">i</span><strong>An update about Altruist</strong></div><p>On August 26, 2026, Vanguard announced an agreement to acquire Altruist. The transaction was announced as subject to closing conditions and regulatory approvals. Altruist was expected to continue operating as a standalone business following closing.</p><a href="https://corporate.vanguard.com/content/corporatesite/us/en/corp/who-we-are/pressroom/press-release-vanguard-announcement-082626.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read Vanguard’s official announcement <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="confidence-disclaimer">RIPL Wealth is an independent investment adviser; Vanguard has not endorsed or sponsored RIPL. This announcement does not change investment risks or imply that Vanguard guarantees client assets.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="results" class="results wrap" hidden aria-labelledby="result-title"></section>
<section class="recognition wrap" aria-labelledby="recognition-heading"><div class="recognition-header"><p class="eyebrow">SOUND FAMILIAR?</p><h2 id="recognition-heading">You’re great at building a business.<br/><em>What about wealth outside it?</em></h2><p>There isn’t one financial question every owner should ask. Here are a few we hear worth exploring.</p></div><div class="recognition-grid"><a href="#videos" data-focus-video="1"><span>01 / BUILD OUTSIDE THE BUSINESS</span><h3>"Everything I make goes right back into the company."</h3><p>What would it look like to build wealth that doesn't depend entirely on the business?</p><strong>Explore this question →</strong></a><a href="#videos" data-focus-video="2"><span>02 / CONNECT YOUR ADVISORS</span><h3>"My CPA and investment decisions don't really connect."</h3><p>Important financial decisions deserve a conversation between the right people, before action is taken.</p><strong>Explore this question →</strong></a><a href="#videos" data-focus-video="3"><span>03 / GIVE CASH A PURPOSE</span><h3>"We've got cash, but I'm not sure what to do with it."</h3><p>Start by distinguishing the money the business needs from money with a longer horizon.</p><strong>Explore this question →</strong></a></div><p class="recognition-footer">You don't need to know which solution you need. <a href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-placement="recognition">That's a good reason to talk. ↗</a></p></section>
<section class="review-section wrap" aria-label="Two minute money review"><div class="review-context"><p class="eyebrow">A SIMPLE PLACE TO START</p><h2>Not sure where to start? <em>Start here.</em></h2><p>Answer seven quick questions to identify which financial conversation could be most useful. See your result privately. No email, statements, or obligation.</p></div><div class="quiz-card" id="quiz"><div class="quiz-intro"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR MONEY STARTING POINT</span><span class="quiz-time">About 2 minutes</span></div><h2 class="quiz-promise">Where could your money use more clarity?</h2><p class="quiz-explain">Seven quick questions help you choose a practical starting point.<br/> Get your result privately, with no email required.</p><div class="progress-wrap"><span id="step-label">Question 1 of 7</span><div class="progress" role="progressbar" aria-label="Review progress" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="7" aria-valuenow="0"><i></i></div></div><div id="quiz-content"><h3 class="question-title" tabindex="-1">{initial.title}</h3><p class="hint">{initial.hint}</p><div class="options" role="group" aria-label={initial.title}>{initial.options.map((a,i)=><button class="answer" type="button" data-answer={i} aria-pressed="false"><span class="answer-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>{a}</span></button>)}</div><div class="quiz-nav"><button class="back" type="button" disabled>← Back</button><button class="button next" type="button" disabled>Continue <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div></div><p class="quiz-foot">No personal financial numbers. No documents. No sales gate.</p><a class="quiet-link" href="#videos">Prefer to watch first? Start with a question below ↓</a><noscript><p>Please enable JavaScript to take the review. You can still watch the linked videos or <a href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com">email Adam</a>.</p></noscript></div></section>

<section id="videos" class="video-section wrap"><div class="section-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL QUESTIONS. STRAIGHT ANSWERS.</p><h2>A question on your mind?<br/> <em>Let’s start there.</em></h2></div><p>Short videos in plain English, from a real person.<br/> Start with the question that fits your situation.</p></div><div class="video-toolbar"><div id="filters" class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter topics by life stage"><button type="button" data-stage="All" class="active" aria-pressed="true">All questions</button>{stages.map(s=><button type="button" data-stage={s} aria-pressed="false">{stageLabels[s]}</button>)}</div><p id="video-count" class="video-count" aria-live="polite">5 videos ready to watch</p></div><div class="video-grid" id="video-grid">{orderedVideos().map(v=><article class:list={['video-card',{'is-placeholder':!v.youtubeId}]}><a class="video-trigger" href={v.youtubeId?`https://youtu.be/${v.youtubeId}`:'#contact'} data-video={v.id} aria-label={v.youtubeId?`Watch ${v.shortTitle}`:`Read about ${v.shortTitle}`}><div class="video-art"><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="480" height="270"/><div class="video-shade"></div><span class="video-label">{v.stage}</span><span class="video-play" aria-hidden="true">{v.youtubeId?'▶':'+'}</span><span class="video-status">{v.youtubeId?'Watch with Adam':'Video coming soon'}</span></div><div class="video-copy"><h3>{v.title}</h3><p class="short-title">{v.shortTitle}</p></div></a><p class="risk">{v.risk}</p></article>)}</div><p class="library-note">A starting point for a conversation, not a recommendation for your individual situation.</p></section>
<section id="about" class="about"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div class="adam-portrait"><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam.webp" alt="Adam Kasick in the RIPL office" loading="lazy" width="640" height="800"/><div class="portrait-caption"><strong>Adam Kasick</strong><span>Business owner. Wealth manager.</span></div></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">YOU BUILT SOMETHING. WE RESPECT THAT.</p><h2>A real person.<br/> In your corner.<br/> <em>Beyond the first call.</em></h2><p>I’m Adam. I know what it’s like to have the business take up most of the calendar—and leave your own financial questions for “when things slow down.”</p><p>At RIPL, I help owners connect those questions. Investments, cash, conversations with your CPA, and the life you want beyond the company. We call our planning process SAGE™.</p><p>You should understand what’s being considered, why it matters, and what the tradeoffs are. And you should feel comfortable asking the next question.</p><p class="signature">Give every dollar a job.</p><div class="about-links"><a class="button button-gold" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-placement="about">Meet with Adam ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="https://riplwealth.com/team/adam-kasick/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More about Adam ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="service-section wrap"><div class="section-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WORKING TOGETHER SHOULD FEEL LIKE</p><h2>Clear conversations.<br/> <em>Thoughtful follow-through.</em></h2></div><p>Good service isn’t a claim. It’s how we communicate, coordinate, and follow through.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><article><span class="service-number">01</span><h3>We listen first.</h3><p>Your goals, concerns, and existing relationships give the plan its direction.</p></article><article><span class="service-number">02</span><h3>We connect the pieces.</h3><p>We work alongside your CPA and other professionals so decisions can be considered together.</p></article><article><span class="service-number">03</span><h3>We make the next step clear.</h3><p>Plain explanations. Room for questions. Clarity about what needs attention and who should be involved.</p></article></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A SMALL COMMITMENT. A REAL CONVERSATION.</p><h2>Bring the question<br/> you keep<br/> <em>putting off.</em></h2><p class="contact-lead">Thirty minutes with Adam. No obligation to hire RIPL. No stack of statements needed.</p><ol class="meeting-list"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Tell me what’s on your mind.</strong><p>We’ll start with what matters to you.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Work through the moving pieces.</strong><p>What do we know? What needs a closer look?</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Identify a useful next step.</strong><p>My goal is that you leave with something you can use, whether or not we work together.</p></div></li></ol><a class="button" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-placement="contact">Choose a time with Adam <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="booking-note">Free introductory conversation · 30 minutes · Meet over Zoom</p></div><div class="question-panel"><span class="eyebrow">RATHER START WITH AN EMAIL?</span><h3>Ask the short version.</h3><p>You don’t have to book a meeting to start a conversation.</p><form id="contact-form"><label for="contact-name">Your name<input id="contact-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required/></label><label for="contact-email">Email<input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required/></label><label for="contact-message">What’s on your mind?<textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="3" maxlength="2500" required placeholder="The thing I’d like to figure out is…"></textarea></label><div class="quiz-share" hidden><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="include_result"/><span>Include my completed money review so Adam has the context.</span></label></div><label class="check-label consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required/><span>I’d like Adam at RIPL to respond to my inquiry.</span></label><input type="text" name="website" class="honeypot" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true"/><button class="button" id="send-button" type="submit">Send my question <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p id="form-status" role="status"></p><p class="form-note">No newsletter signup. Please leave out account numbers and private financial documents. Delivery is processed by FormSubmit. <a href="/money-at-work-privacy/">Privacy details</a>.</p></form><div class="direct-contact"><span>Or use your own inbox</span><a href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com">adam@riplwealth.com ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="faq wrap" aria-labelledby="faq-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS YOU MIGHT BE WONDERING</p><h2 id="faq-heading">Before we talk.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Is this going to turn into a sales pitch?</summary><p>The first conversation starts with your question. There’s no obligation to hire RIPL. If there may be a fit, we can discuss what working together would involve. You decide whether to continue.</p></details><details><summary>I already have a CPA. Do I need to replace them?</summary><p>No. RIPL works alongside your tax professional. We help coordinate investment and planning conversations; your CPA provides tax advice and prepares your return.</p></details><details><summary>What do I need to bring?</summary><p>One question and a rough sense of what you’d like to figure out. You don’t need to upload documents or provide account numbers to have an introductory conversation.</p></details><details><summary>Can we meet over Zoom?</summary><p>Yes. Use Adam’s calendar to choose a time. The booking confirmation will provide the meeting details.</p></details><details><summary>What does it cost?</summary><p>The introductory conversation is free. If we explore working together, we’ll discuss the scope and fees before you decide. There’s no obligation to become a client.</p></details></div></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="wrap"><div class="footer-top"><div class="brand"><img src="/ripl-logo.png" alt="RIPL Wealth" width="112" height="40"/><span>BUILD TOMORROW TODAY.</span></div><p>Fort Collins, Colorado<br/> <a href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com">adam@riplwealth.com</a></p><div class="footer-links"><a href="/money-at-work-privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="https://riplwealth.com/disclosures/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Disclosures ↗</a><a href="https://riplwealth.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit RIPL Wealth ↗</a></div></div><p class="disclosure">RIPL Wealth is a registered investment adviser. This website is for informational purposes only and does not constitute investment, tax, or legal advice. RIPL does not provide tax or legal advice and works alongside your tax professional. Investing involves risk, including possible loss of principal.</p><p class="disclosure">The money review reflects your answers today. It is an educational conversation guide, not a financial plan, suitability assessment, or determination of tax savings. Your priorities may change.</p><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} RIPL Wealth</span><span>Give every dollar a job.</span></div></div></footer>
<div class="mobile-bar" hidden><a href="#quiz">My starting point</a><a href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-placement="mobile">Talk with Adam ↗</a></div>
<dialog id="video-dialog" aria-labelledby="video-title"><div class="dialog-top"><span class="eyebrow">A CONVERSATION STARTER WITH ADAM</span><button class="dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="Close video">×</button></div><div id="video-player"></div><div class="video-detail"><p class="eyebrow" id="video-stage"></p><h2 id="video-title"></h2><p id="video-answer"></p><p class="risk" id="video-risk"></p><div class="dialog-actions"><a class="button" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-placement="video">Talk this through with Adam ↗</a><button class="text-button" id="video-question" type="button">Ask about this by email →</button></div><p class="form-note">30 minutes · No obligation · Start with your question</p></div></dialog>
<dialog id="booking-dialog" aria-labelledby="booking-title"><div class="dialog-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">MEET ADAM</p><h2 id="booking-title">Let’s put a time on it.</h2></div><button class="booking-close" type="button" aria-label="Close calendar">×</button></div><p class="booking-intro">A free, 30-minute introductory conversation. Bring one question. No documents needed.</p><a class="calendar-fallback" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open calendar in a new tab ↗</a><div id="calendar-status" role="status"></div><div id="calendar-embed"></div><div id="booking-success" hidden><h3>You’re on the calendar.</h3><p>Look for Calendly’s confirmation and meeting details.</p></div><div class="booking-context" hidden><p>Your starting point stays available here. You can send it to Adam separately if you’d like him to have it before the call.</p><button type="button" class="text-button" id="share-before-call">Send Adam my starting point →</button></div></dialog>
<script is:inline type="module" src="/money-at-work/campaign.js"></script></body></html>
